(Phnom Penh): On August 7, 2018, FUNCINPEC sent a message of thanks to its members and leaders for doing a better job. Meanwhile, the old Royalist Party claims that after the results of the election, FUNCINPEC ranks second among the 20 political parties that competed in the 6th legislative election.
