(Phnom Penh): The Anti-Counterfeit Products Committee, which poses a high risk to health and social safety (CPPCC), held a press conference on the afternoon of August 6, 2018 at the Ministry of Interior for details. About the operation to crack down on 4 crimes, confiscated nearly 100 tons of exhibits in the past.
