Representative of Minister Vong Soth leads a team to visit CPP activists after suffering a broken wrist and being hospitalized
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hach Hean, Director General of the Department of Administration and Finance, representing Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, on August 3, 2018, led a working group to visit Mr. Las Sok, an activist. Local Cambodian People's Party, Kong Kang Commune, Ponhea Krek District, Tbong Khmum Province.
Las Sok, a local CPP activist in Kong Kang commune, suffered a broken wrist and is being treated at Preah Kosomak Hospital, also known as Lok Sang Hospital, and will undergo emergency surgery on the afternoon of August 3, 2018.
