At the same time, the Director of the Ministry of Education confirmed that the Royal School of Judges has been established for eight generations since 2002, with 452 graduates, including prosecutors from the Public Administration Administration, recruiting and ensuring the professional training of judges. Continuing training and recruitment of judges and prosecutors working in the tribunal.
In addition, the Royal School of Registration has been established for 5 generations. As of 2018, there are about 600 graduates from all over the country. Having completed 2 years of vocational training, be physically fit, receive salaries and pensions from the state, the registrar is a civil servant with civil service.
