As for the connection at any time, it is the decision of Tai Seng Bavet SEZ Co., Ltd. and EDC is always ready to cooperate. "This is a win-win situation. People are happy and have easy access to their homes, and the Tai Seng Special Economic Zone does not have a shortage of electricity in its factories."
