Paradise Island Maldives is attracting tourists from all over in 2018!
(Maldives): Tourism of the Maldives, a popular destination for travel and leisure, has been gaining momentum in 2018. This was quoted from the Chinese news agency Xinhua on Friday evening, August 3, 2018.
The number of tourists visiting the Maldives reported a 17 percent increase during the first quarter of 2018 compared to the same period last year. Similarly, during the first quarter of this year, the average rate of tourists staying overnight increased by 18 percent.
During the same quarter, the Maldives industry earned $ 993.5 million, up 20 percent from the same period in 2017. According to the latest statistics from the Maldives Ministry of Tourism, a total of 726,515 tourists visited here during the first six months of 2018, an increase of 10.5 percent compared to the same period last year.
