Chinese Foreign Minister Congratulates Cambodia on National Election Success
(Phnom Penh): Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi joins in celebrating the success of the 6th National Assembly election in Cambodia.
The congratulations were made on the occasion of the Chinese Foreign Minister's meeting with Senior Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs of Cambodia, on August 1, 2018.
After the meeting between the two ministers on the sidelines of the ASEAN Summit in Singapore, the Chinese Foreign Ministry issued a statement saying that Chinese Foreign Minister and State Councilor Wang Yi also offered congratulations. For the election in Cambodia that went very smoothly.
At the same time, Mr. Wang Yi said that the election results clearly show the support and trust of the Cambodian people to the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party. Wang also said that China will continue to provide more assistance to Cambodia to maintain stability and further development.
