(Phnom Penh): A case of four and a half plainclothes police officers working at the General Department of Logistics and Finance, Ministry of Interior, using a pistol to shoot himself in Room 209 of Hotel and Karaoke "Koloso" in Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang III, Khan Chamkar Mon There was a surprise on the afternoon of August 1, 2018 due to a personal crisis.
According to the victim's family, on August 2, 2018, the victim, 26-year-old Mon Rattanak Udom, was a four-and-a-half-year-old police officer living in Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 2, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh. Kork Svay, Russey Krok commune, Angkor Borei district, Banteay Meanchey province, left home about a few days ago until the shooting.
Meanwhile, local police officers who conducted a thorough search and investigation confirmed that the victim had indeed shot himself with a 54mm pistol and shot his right eyebrow. To die in bed.
If the victim police officer opened the hotel room on July 31, 2018, and he called his girlfriend for the last time, until the afternoon of August 1, yesterday, there was a case He shot himself in the first step and with the explanation from his family, the competent authorities can conclude that the victim had a personal crisis and decided to commit suicide.
However, according to the explanation from the karaoke staff, after opening the room to enter the room, they did not see the victim coming out to get food and water, so the staff went up and knocked on the door of the room for a long time, still did not open the door, decided to knock on the door immediately. The victim was found dead in the room, did not know when he died, and then complained to the authorities to come down to check at the scene immediately.
