Due to these phenomena, the business people in Phnom Penh are worried about the security and order in Phnom Penh, so much so that they do not dare to open their doors to do business, some people even buy food to prepare in their homes. In that, some motorcycle and car dealers do not dare to open their doors for many days.
Unlike in 2013 for the 6th National Assembly election in 2018, it was calm and did not cause any fear to the people through any outbreak of protests or violence.
