5-star Prince Time Hotel will open in September after completion today
(Sihanoukville): The 5-star Prince Time Hotel Sihanoukville, a development project of Prince Real Estate (Cambodia), will be inaugurated in September 2018 after the official completion of construction at July 31, 2018.
Mr. Chhiv Koursinh, Chief Executive Officer of Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group, praised the quality of construction, speed of construction and construction management. He also thanked all the relevant partners who cooperated well and supported the project to make the construction run smoothly and successfully completed as planned.
Prince Time Hotel is the first 5-star luxury hotel project directly managed and operated by Prince Time Hotel Management, a subsidiary of the giant Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group. The hotel has a total area of 29,000 square meters, built on an area of 1.2 hectares, located near the beach and downtown Sihanoukville is a five-star luxury hotel and business.
Prince Time Hotel officially started construction on April 9, 2017. The hotel will be officially inaugurated on September 28, 2018.
