(Battambang): Police in Battambang province this morning, July 31, 2018, arrested a suspect and sent 29 bags of ice cubes to the Battambang Provincial Court for legal action after being arrested for a crime. At 2:15 am on July 29, 2018 at the intersection of four roads in Daun May village, Sdao commune, Rattanak Mondul district.
Sean Sonal, director of the Battambang Provincial Anti-Drug Police Office, said that the suspect was Phoeun Sopha, a 22-year-old man from Prey Ampor village, Andek Hep commune, Rattanak Mondul district, Battambang province. The confiscated items include: 29 small ice cubes weighing 3.60 grams and other items.
At present, the suspects and exhibits have been sent to the provincial court by the Battambang Provincial Police Commissioner's Office for legal action.
