(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhun Sopheak, Representative of Ms. Teav Thida, First Deputy Chief of Sangkat Stung Meanchey II Assistance Team, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh, donated a charitable donation to the families of two elderly people living in Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh This July 2018.
