According to Article 8.6.26 of the Rules and Procedures for the 2018 National Assembly Election, "If the election reaches 3:00 pm on Election Day, which is the deadline for the end of the election process, but voters "Being in the polling station or standing in line inside the polling station, those voters are allowed to vote."
