After the official launch, the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia has been open for membership until July 18, 2018, the Ministry of Economy and Finance has announced that the fund has received 130 founding members, members. 107 honorary members, 46,397 supporting members and 890 other philanthropists, receiving 3,537,646,150 Riels and $ 4,915,095 in donations.
