In addition to establishing the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia to support Kantha Bopha Hospital, the Royal Government of Cambodia has deducted $ 2 per ticket from the Angkor resort to the Kantha Bopha Foundation.
In fact, in the first six months of 2018, the ticket sales of Angkor, which was funded by Kantha Bopha Hospital, totaled 2,713,922 million US dollars.
