Preah Sihanouk Provincial Head of Natural Resource Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Organization Arrested for Using Fraudulent Uniforms
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Armed Forces arrested the Director of the Office of Natural Resource Protection and Biodiversity Conservation in Preah Sihanouk Province for using fake uniforms such as the Armed Forces and sent to court on July 26, 2018. Provinces to punish according to law.
Speaking to Fresh News on July 26, the Sihanoukville Provincial Gendarmerie confirmed that the director of the Preah Sihanouk Provincial Office for the Protection of Natural Resources and Biodiversity Conservation was arrested on the evening of July 25 yesterday. Sophat, 52, lives in Koki village, Bit Trang commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province.
According to the military officer, the suspect was involved in the use of a uniform similar to that of the police or the military (Article 616) and the use of a non-official identity in public affairs (Article 621) and the use of documents. Fake public (Article 630).
