This partnership means that Cambodian farmers who purchase agricultural machinery and equipment through JC Finance can repay their monthly loan through the Wing Smartphone app code * 989 # or at more than 5,000 Wing agents. Nationwide. Farmers also benefit from the low deposit and interest rates offered by this Japanese financial service provider.
Jojo Malolos, CEO of Wing Specialized Bank, believes that JC Finance and Wing Specialized Bank are the ideal partners with the big goal of making it easier for thousands of farmers to repay their loans. Through this partnership, thousands of local farmers are able to focus on agricultural work and income generation in their communities.
"It is in Wing's vision that we always put our customers and partners at the heart of everything we do," Malolos said. "Such a partnership can make it easier for farmers to repay their monthly loans and enable JC Finance to provide services to target clients living in remote communities."
A customer who buys a tractor for plowing his farm, Mr. Bun Bunthoeun said that he always pays the loan to Jesse Finance through Wing because it is not far from his house. In addition, he can also perform other transactions such as mobile top-ups from Wing agents.
Mr. Koo Nam, Executive Director of JC Finance, stated that this partnership has created new opportunities for JC Finance to bring skills and experience from Japan to improve the agricultural sector in Cambodia for farmers. In the countryside, most of them rely on the sale of agricultural products as income to support their families.
"We are looking forward to the fruitful results of this partnership, as well as the introduction of new financial services that support agricultural productivity and profitability to increase the income of Cambodian farmers," Koho Nam said.
In addition to payments through Wing, customers can also create WING accounts to make cashless transactions such as online bill payment, mobile top-up, money transfer and more. It is very easy to create a Wing account, customers can download the Wing smartphone app and fill in the required information or go to a Wing agent to create a Wing account.
