(Phnom Penh): On July 25, 2018, Cellcard announced an additional guarantee on its service network to strengthen its leadership in delivering leading quality while receiving the award. Once again this month, the Ookla® Prize makes this pure Cambodian telecommunications company a leading operator.
This online warranty will automatically reimburse the customer when the customer encounters a service interruption every time a call is made to the system. It should also be noted that Cellcard is the first telecommunications company in Cambodia to establish a network guarantee in order to increase the trust and transparency of services to customers.
Cellcard CEO Ian Watson said that customers in Cambodia deserve world-class quality of service from their telecom operators, including good coverage, high speed internet and affordable prices.
"This is the promise of Cellcard to provide our customers with the best network, the best value, as well as the best customer service," said Ian Watson.
Mr. Watson said that Cellcard has been busy informing customers about network malfunctions as quality upgrades and network expansions are underway.
In addition, we also make public announcements on the website in case of emergencies such as storms, severe weather waves and construction faults that cause damage to the telephone network.
"We are building the best network in Cambodia and service disruptions are possible," Watson said. "But what is important is the speed of service recovery, and in particular the provision of information to our customers."
He said that ensuring Cellcard's network will make our activities and commitments fully transparent and open, while we continue to provide the most affordable mobile data for all Cambodians. All for national and economic development. All troops in Kampong Thom province are constantly waiting for orders from their superiors to join forces to protect peace, security and public order during the election process.
