(Phnom Penh): The Governor of Phnom Penh and the Chairman of the Unity Command, Mr. Khuong Sreng and General Chuon Sovann, Deputy Commissioner of the National Police and the Commissioner of Phnom Penh on July 25, 2018, ordered the Phnom Penh Police Force to prevent and Suppress all activities that want to destroy the process of the 6th National Assembly election, which will take place on July 29, 2018.
