During 2009, the governments of Antigua and Barbuda signed a visa waiver agreement with the European Union, allowing them to travel to all Schengen countries without a visa.
For the passports of Antigua and Barbuda, this is the best travel document that can be used for travel to more than 130 countries, including the United Kingdom, Hong Kong, Singapore and Europe without a visa requirement.
