(Oddar Meanchey, Anlong Veng): Anlong Veng district, Oddar Meanchey province, was one of the last areas where the Khmer Rouge used as a stronghold of the regime after the overthrow of the National Salvation Front on January 7, 1979. .
Prior to integration, join the Royal Government of Cambodia in late 1998 through win-win politics. Anlong Veng district is a quiet and undeveloped area with no infrastructure, no education, while the living conditions of the people are very poor.
Twenty years after the end of the war, Anlong Veng has become a new face. Under the policy led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Anlong Veng district has received equal development like other areas in Cambodia. The infrastructure, education and living standards of the people have been improved.
Speaking during a visit to students preparing for the Baccalaureate exam at Hun Sen Anlong Veng High School on Saturday, July 21, 2018, Mr. Kun Kim, Chairman of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Strengthening Committee, noted that in addition to the infrastructure and living conditions of The people are well developed and education in this former battlefield is also being taken care of and improved.
Mr. Kun Kim said that while improving the quality of education, more educational infrastructure systems have been built to serve education. Many school buildings in Anlong Veng district were provided by Samdech Techo Hun Sen in 2016 during his visit through the area.
Currently, the school buildings have been completed and put students to study. Samdech Techo Hun Sen has also confirmed the project to develop the infrastructure system and improve the education sector in Oddar Meanchey.
Samdech Techo stated that his win-win policy would not be successful if the Khmer Rouge soldiers joined the Royal Government and did not make any development efforts to improve the lives of the people. Samdech Techo further stated that human resource development in that area is still a priority area like in other areas.
During the visit, Mr. Kun Kim reminded and exhorted all students to make efforts to absorb knowledge to contribute to the development of the country, especially to move the land of Anlong Veng district to grow.
With smiles under the roof of the new school building, a group of students who are receiving attention from the Royal Government to provide education to them, thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen who Provided a new school building for them.
In return for the new building provided by the Royal Government, local students in Anlong Veng district have committed to study hard to bring knowledge to contribute to national development with the Royal Government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen. Reviewers Reverse in the Independence Monument, continues, last night, two more vehicles
