(Kampong Cham): Dr. Chhim Sareth, Chief of Central Working Group for Batheay District in charge of Youth Affairs and Dr. Moeng Makara, Chief of Youth Advisory Team of Cheung Prey District on July 22, 2018 participated in the search campaign. Votes for the 6th National Assembly Election 2018 in Batheay and Cheung Prey Districts, Kampong Cham Province.
The program also has the close and active cooperation of the members of the Central Working Group to assist the districts in charge of youth work in both districts, as well as the chairman of the district and commune party committees. The large-scale election campaign march lasted for one full morning, in strict accordance with the rules, regulations and procedures for the election.
