CamControl officers inspected some petrol depots in Toul Kork district, found a depot selling fuel incorrectly and told to correct immediately
(Phnom Penh): The fuel inspection team of the General Department of CamControl of the Ministry of Commerce this morning, July 20, 2018, through a mobile fuel laboratory vehicle led by Mr. Nguon Somlyvong, Deputy Director of the Department in cooperation with professional officers of the Department. The experiments inspected the quantity and quality of fuel at a number of stations and depots located in Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
Mr. Nguon Somllyvong stated that this operation is aimed at protecting the economic interests of consumers, protecting the machinery of all types of vehicles and protecting the environment arising from improper fuel combustion, and especially to prevent fraud.
This quality and quantity control is based on on-site monitoring equipment, such as calibrators with specific volumes for measuring the amount of oil fired from the counter in different sizes, 5L, 10L and 20L. The octane and cetan indexes are used in mobile laboratory vehicles.
As a result of quality control and quantity of fuel of 5 stations and depots in the above location, there are 4 stations and depots that comply with the quality and measurement, while 1 depot has a lack of fuel in accordance with the standard. Measurement. Inspection officials have asked the station and depot owners to make a contract to adjust the vending machine according to the correct prediction through the competent authority.
He added that all vehicle users must consider in advance to choose a gas station / depot, a company that trusts the use of new equipment, sells regular gasoline or soup and good quality diesel, and all liters check the counter number from zero. Always, before refueling, monitor the operation of the counter number, which must be started together with the injector until the last liter.
At the same time, he also asked people to follow the announcement of the fuel price of the Ministry of Commerce and be careful of fire safety by turning off the engine when refueling at the station and please provide information to the Camcontrol officers in the capital or province. Come to the General Department of CamControl in case of any eventual event. Check out the selection of pictures from the international event on July 20, 2018! (Photo inside)
