First, associations and non-governmental organizations that have applied to participate in the election observation, which are recognized by the NEC, have the right to observe and issue election evaluation statements in accordance with the laws, regulations and procedures of the NEC. NEC and Code of Conduct for Election Observers in the Electoral Process.
Third, associations and non-governmental organizations that have not applied for registration as election observers at the NEC may not be able to carry out their activities and statements, which can be concluded as an election evaluation. No.
