Mr. Vy Samnang, Governor of Kampong Speu Province, stated that the reason for the suspension was due to the flooding that cut off National Road 4 at km 90 (Kampong Speu province) and km 15 (Sihanoukville). However, both provincial authorities have called on residents wishing to travel to Sihanoukville and Koh Kong to use National Road 41 and National Road 3 instead.
