"China's economy is stable and has good growth momentum, and the enforcement of laws and regulations will lay the foundation for the future development of the security system," said Zhou Fowling, director of the Social Security Research Center at the University of Finance and Economics. Society, too. "We have also strengthened our capacity, which includes payment, services and management to ensure the well-being of the people."
