Samdech has announced that he will make efforts to promote the inclusion of other Cambodian temples in the World Heritage List. Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his gratitude to the team of Samdech Vibol Panha Sok An for their efforts to include the Temple of Preah Vihear as a World Heritage Site.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the policy of building peace along the border with neighboring countries is a necessary policy for nation building and people's livelihood. It was the most difficult time 10 years ago due to the emergence of hostility with Thailand. When Cambodia prepares the election process.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he set out three mechanisms at the same time. The mechanisms include: Level for the army to stagnate, 2. Use diplomacy to open the door of the UN Security Council; and The International Court of Justice in The Hague to interpret the Hague Code.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that starting from the border dispute with Thailand in the past, it is clear that building peace, relations and cooperation on the border is still an important issue.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked his compatriots for supporting the Royal Government on cultural issues, especially when the Temple of Preah Vihear was inscribed on the World Heritage List. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there is no success without participation. The participation of the people has become a protection for national cultural heritage and also a protection for Cambodia.
