Angkor Resort was inscribed on the World Heritage List on December 14, 1992.
2: Royal Ballet or Khmer Classical Dance was inscribed on the Intangible Heritage of Humanity List on November 7, 2003
3: The Big Skin Shadow Theater was inscribed on the Intangible Heritage of Humanity List on November 25, 2005
4: The Temple of Preah Vihear was inscribed on the World Heritage List on July 7, 2008.
