According to the report of the National Bank of Cambodia, which was received by Fresh News on July 15, 2018, the rapid increase in the riel was due to the people's trust in the riel. Will continue to spend in riel. This increase has actively contributed to the environmentally friendly growth of Cambodia.
Mr. Chea Chanto, Governor-General of the National Bank of Cambodia, said that as the National Monetary Authority, the National Bank of Cambodia has been involved in maintaining price stability by carefully implementing monetary policy in line with market developments and strengthening policy effectiveness. Currency in sequence. In fact, the money supply in the economy is moderate, keeping the exchange rate stable.
He added that maintaining the stability of the riel has contributed to maintaining public confidence in the riel, however, the continued use of the riel continues to expand and this is a necessary factor for improving efficiency. Of monetary policy implementation.
At the same time, the adult population receiving financial services has reached 57% of the total adult population, mainly supported by the microfinance sector and the advancement of financial technology. In order to continue to develop the financial sector sustainably, oversight and regulation have also been steadily promoted, especially on strengthening capital, liquidity and systematic risk management, while strengthening consumer protection.
Mr. Chea Chanto expressed his pride in the banking sector, which is playing a key role in supporting economic growth over the past 20 years, the contribution is made by providing financial services to companies, businesses and people to create and expand. Economic activities that contribute to economic growth and job creation, promote equity and efficiency. Top 10 Voter Countries in the World
