Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the 10th and 1st Anniversary of the Inclusion of Preah Vihear and Sambor Prei Kuk in the World Heritage List
The celebration of Cambodia's success in inscribing the two treasures into the World Heritage Site was presided over by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross. Also. In particular, there will be invitations from government officials, the armed forces, students, thousands of people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expects France to win the World Cup in Russia tonight
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts and all stakeholders for celebrating the 10th and 1st anniversary of the inclusion of the Temple of Preah Vihear and Sambor Prei Kuk in the World Heritage List.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the former kings of all generations for their efforts to build a large number of temples for Cambodia and included them in the World Heritage List. Samdech Techo Hun Sen has announced that he will work to promote the inclusion of other Cambodian temples in the World Heritage List.
* Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, stated that the policy of building peace along the border with neighboring countries is a necessary policy for nation building and people's livelihood.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen pays tribute to His Majesty the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, for supporting the Royal Government of Cambodia in proposing both temples to be inscribed on the World Heritage List.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his gratitude to the team of Samdech Vibol Panha Sok An for their efforts to include the Temple of Preah Vihear as a World Heritage Site.
* The head of the Royal Government stated that it was the most difficult time 10 years ago due to the emergence of hostilities with Thailand as Cambodia prepares for the election process.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech set out three mechanisms at the same time. The mechanisms include: Level for the army to stagnate, 2. Use diplomacy to open the door of the UN Security Council; and The International Court of Justice in The Hague to interpret the Hague Code.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expected that the Thai side would not adhere to what Samdech reminded of past clashes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that starting from the border dispute with Thailand in the past, it is clear that building peace, relations and cooperation along the border is still an important issue.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the priority policy of the Royal Government is to turn all former war zones into markets and development, and now many former war zones are becoming development zones.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked his compatriots for supporting the Royal Government on cultural issues, especially when the Temple of Preah Vihear was inscribed on the World Heritage List.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there is no success without participation. The participation of the people has become a protection for national cultural heritage and also a protection for Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on his compatriots to protect the temples that have been included in the World Heritage List and other temples that have not yet been included.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that we must work together to preserve the works that are the heritage of Khmer ancestors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also asked for understanding and tolerance for some people living near the Preah Vihear temple area who had to change their place of residence in order to meet the conditions of UNESCO.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked all Cambodians and participants in this evening's ceremony to stand up and pay their respects to the victims of the floods in Japan.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen ended his speech at 18:48 this Sunday.
