(Prey Veng): The people of Kamchay Mear district are determined to win the first place again in the election for the Cambodian People's Party for the 6th National Assembly election on July 29, 2018. .
The commitment of the people of Kamchay Mear district was made in front of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Working Group of the CPP in Prey Veng and Battambang provinces during the election campaign on July 14, 2018.
During the election campaign on July 14, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party, selected six districts in Prey Veng province as the target of the election campaign.
Samdech Sar Kheng started his campaign by leaving Kamchay Mear district, where there were nearly 3,000 CPP members with fresh faces in CPP uniforms, some sitting and some standing waiting to welcome the presence of Sar Kheng. .
Around the venue, the ceremony was simple but attractive with the banner of the slogan of the Cambodian People's Party and a large billboard highlighting the image of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, Honorary President of the Party. And pictures of the achievements of the CPP.
