First, respect and protect the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia, protect the monarchy and all national achievements to last forever, promote liberal democracy, pluralism and respect for human rights.
Second, to protect independence, sovereignty, territorial integrity and peace, to prevent any force from invading and destroying it, and to absolutely oppose foreign interference in Cambodia's internal affairs.
Third, to build the Kingdom of Cambodia as a strong and progressive state based on the law, to ensure fair application of the law for all citizens, every citizen has full rights and duties to actively participate in building and defending the motherland.
