She stated that the main purpose of wanting to establish a cultural village and market selling indigenous products is to participate in promoting the cultural traditions of the indigenous people in this northeastern province by building houses according to the ethnic groups. Each ethnic group, for example, if the Kreung people build houses in the Kreung way, if the Jarai people follow the Jarai way.
The establishment of a market for indigenous products is intended to improve the livelihoods of indigenous peoples so that Cambodians in other areas can see and recognize indigenous handicrafts and buy. Use or eat or keep as a souvenir.
