(Kampong Cham): Mr. Pan Sosak, Chairman of the Central Working Group for Prey Chhor District and a Member of the Cambodian People's Party for Kampong Cham Province, raised a question for the people to consider and decide on choosing a political party that has the ability to maintain Peace and lead Cambodia towards real development in the coming national election day.
