President Pan Sosak raised all these questions during the election campaign of the 6th National Assembly election held in Tong Rong and Chrey Vien communes of Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province on the morning of July 14, 2018. Attended by local authorities, members of the Cambodian People's Party and more than 700 people.
