"We call on the public to be wary of publicity, fundraising and trading transactions for unlicensed electronic headphones from the relevant authorities," the statement said. "For any person or company that advertises, mobilizes, raises funds, conducts transactions, trades, electronic payments without a license from the competent authorities and is subject to legal penalties."
