Mr. Ho Vandy, General Director of World Express Travel Company, said that the situation of tourism business in Cambodia has not changed, that is, it is still good while Cambodia is preparing for the election process. Mr. Ho Vandy also saw that the business situation during the election in the new mandate is also a good sign compared to the previous mandate.
Speaking to reporters this morning, July 13, 2018, the CEO of World Express Travel Company stated that "everything is not negative so far. "In that, the tourism industry, especially in the airline sector, is still operating normally and is evolving."
Mr. Ho Vandy said that during this period, the number of tourists also increased significantly. "During this period, we see an increase in the number of tourists at all tour companies, busy in business," he added.
Apart from no change in the tourism industry, there is no change in the garment and footwear industry during the election process. Ken Loo, secretary-general of the Garment Manufacturers Association of Cambodia, said that despite the upcoming election, the garment sector in Cambodia was still operating normally and there was no difference.
