Mr. Prean Prom, Ampil commune chief, stated that on behalf of the authorities and all the people, he was really happy to get this canal back. He said that before the dry canal, there was no water in the rainy season, but from now on, his people will have the opportunity to grow crops and other crops, even in the dry season.
