In the meeting to review the implementation of roles, duties and work of the Royal Gendarmerie in the first half of the year and the work direction of the second half of 2018, members in the offices of the Office of the Commander-in-Chief of the District are allowed to report on the activities that have been done in the past and Action that can not be done for any reason.
Brigadier General Chou Sarun said that in the election campaign of the political parties for the 6th National Assembly election in 2018, all forces must work hard to strengthen security, public order, protect social stability, make the election and the campaign. Elections are conducted smoothly, with democracy, freedom and justice.
He added that the deputy commander in charge will continue to mobilize forces to intervene to train and strengthen the military tactical intelligence, ready to help the people and representatives of political parties that are campaigning in the 2018 election.
