He said that all Cambodians must participate in replanting trees everywhere to increase forest resources to maintain the regularity of water sources, climate change, and to favor human-animal life. And favorable for the cultivation of all kinds of crops of farmers.
On that occasion, the King of Cambodia also thanked the friendly countries, international organizations and non-governmental organizations that have been paying attention to assist the Royal Government of Cambodia in planting, maintaining and protecting forest resources, which is an important factor for restoration. And develop the Cambodian socio-economic situation now and in the future.
