Understand the law: Who is a lawyer?
Lawyers are free to practice their profession anywhere in the Kingdom of Cambodia. On the other hand, a person who is a lawyer must be under the control of the Bar Association, an institution that has the legal right to monitor any lawyer who violates professional rules.
A lawyer can perform the following roles:
* A lawyer can represent a client in a civil case with the consent of the client through a letter of attorney representing the mandate in all tribunals and at all stages of the procedure, unless otherwise provided by law, especially in civil cases. Commerce, Administration, Labor, Social Affairs. In the above case, the lawyer plays an active role in finding evidence to present to the court.
