The party of angels is for the nation, religion, the king. The Devata Party has contributed to the continuous improvement of the lives of the people, civil servants, workers, teachers, and the armed forces. The Devata Party is highly committed to safeguarding peace, providing warmth to the Cambodian nation by protecting the integrity of the nation, territory and the value of the lives of all Cambodians.
Nothing falls from the sky by itself, and nothing is perfect. However, the Devata Party has deep virtues that disperse enemies everywhere, giving Cambodia the opportunity to build and develop in all areas. The right political path of the Devata Party makes the nation move forward, making close and distant friends everywhere.
Of course, the world today is not over yet, economic, political, and war. Each country needs smart leaders to solve problems and develop the nation. The case of Cambodia is the same, we need to continue to work together with our good leaders to continue to fight against the enemies of the near and far enemies who have evil tactics to harass Cambodia relentlessly.
The experience and history of our nation have already made it clear that Cambodia has been shattered by political wrongdoing, foreign interference, and politicians who insult the nation. We must not neglect the future of our country to be torn apart by the atrocities of foreign extremists, corrupt politicians, borrowers and resentful politicians.
The heroes of Cambodia sacrificed a lot of fresh flesh and blood to save our country from the killing field regime, civil war and color revolution. We all really owe this great sacrifice and merit. However, in return for our participation in supporting the right path of the Angels, our nation will continue to move forward in peace and prosperity.
In this regard, we would like to thank the "Founder of Peace", Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, a national leader in the modern era who has made Cambodia prosperous and highly respected on the international stage. . This is the example and pride of the nation, the people, the youth and the young women of Cambodia.
We also know very well that some do not give up hatred, do not give up revenge, do not give up murder and malice against Cambodia. The interests of the nation and the people of Cambodia are far less than their own anger and self-interest. This is the danger before us if we are careless.
The victory of the Cambodian People's Party is the victory of each of us. The Angel Party is the core force of the nation. The Angel Party is the soul of the nation. The Angel Party provides coolness to all people.
So, together, we raise the flag of victory high and immortal. On July 29, 2018, it is clear that we will use our rights as the owners of the country to vote for the Cambodian People's Party, the 20th Devata Party, as the only good and right choice to protect, build and develop the nation. Our motherland Cambodia, for ourselves, our families, our children, move forward. Congratulations! The Devata Party is the party of the immortal Cambodian people!
