Deputy PM Men Sam On Encourages Chinese Business Association President in Cambodia to Continue Sino-Cambodian Development Efforts
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, accompanied by Mr. Nop Rath Nimol, Deputy Commander of the Cambodian Armed Forces, met with Mr. Yu LingXiong, Chairman of the Cambodian Armed Forces. Chinese Business Association in Cambodia on July 4, 2018 yesterday.
After listening to Yu Lingxiong's regular work report, Ms. Men Sam An said that the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia is a forum for friendship between Chinese and Cambodian entrepreneurs, investment and mutual relations, and the work of the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia is Provide excellent services and guarantees to Chinese entrepreneurs who come to Cambodia, invest in hard work and forward, pioneering and innovation has achieved excellent results.
At the same time, Ms. Men Sam An also encouraged the President of the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia to continue to make efforts and contribute to the development of Sino-Cambodian friendship. She said that in recent years, with the steady development of Sino-Cambodian relations, the two countries have implemented practical cooperation and friendship in various fields around the "One Belt and One Road" has achieved great results.
According to the guidelines since the establishment of the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia, the association has actively organized local entrepreneurs to invest in Cambodia and has made a number of investment cooperation decisions in the region to Phnom Penh and Sihanoukville. Related to tourism, hotel, medicine, mining, energy and trade.
The association not only organized a delegation of Chinese entrepreneurs to visit Cambodia from the investment talks with the Ministry of Commerce of Cambodia, but also provided support for the relationship between the Royal Government of China and Cambodia has recently cooperated with the Provincial Chamber of Commerce. HeNan China.
In addition, the Department also encouraged the investment of delegations to Cambodia in exchange and cooperation and made the Jiangsu Provincial Police Office of China with the Commander of the Prime Minister Hun Sen of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces to exchange friendship and for the roundtable. New economy "China-Cambodia connected with the leadership of the Ministry of Commerce of China joined together and so on.
The future will be a new state of China-Cambodia business forum with comprehensive, deep, comprehensive and all-inclusive scope, which brings together the association's activities as a theme for organizing exchanges between the government and Chinese-Cambodian inter-enterprise enterprises. .
Notably, with the development and development of global science and technology, the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia has also actively brought new technologies and new applications to Cambodia, strengthening the technology for Cambodia's rapid economic growth. It also brings Cambodian entrepreneurs and resources abroad and captures the wave of global technological development.
Since March 7, under the function of the forum of the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia to integrate the resources of the Chinese side and Cambodia together with the Cambodian Industrial Block Development Association, Cambodia has organized a forum "ASEAN Summit 2018". To get closer to the new technology of the world, bring change and development of Cambodia with ASEAN and the world.
After receiving warm praise from all parties, the association has continued to organize new technology software forums in the Philippines, South Korea, Hong Kong, Macau and Thailand, and regularly exchanged ideas with technology developers. Global and experts in the field.
At the same time, Mr. Yu Lingxiong stated that under the care of the Royal Government of Cambodia and the leaders at all levels, the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia will do the same as before to build an effective "bridge" relationship. Between the government and continue to play the role of the association, at the same time, the association will continue to strengthen innovation and promote change of results.
The president of the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia added that the association will continue to serve the joint development of China and Cambodia and make new contributions to the sustainable development of the two economies. After hearing the report, Deputy Prime Minister Men Sam An praised the association's achievements and affirmed the association's positive role in the long-term development of both countries.
She hopes that in the future, the Chinese Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia will develop realistically and overcome obstacles, move forward in line with the new situation and new proposals of modern development, and pay attention to the development of technology. New, high-tech and imported better and more new technologies for Cambodia to help the Cambodian economy continue to grow.
On that occasion, Mr. Yu Lingxiong and his team also visited General Hing Bun Heang, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces of Cambodia and Commander-in-Chief of the Prime Minister Hun Sen's Bodyguard and General Nop Ratana, Commander of the Artillery Brigade. Of Cambodia.
The two generals are very positive about the work of the Chinese Business Association in Cambodia. The two generals will be strong supporters of the association and fully support the work of the association.
